===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*mēnōþs}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*mēnōt-||month, moon}} < {{m|ine-pro|*mḗh₁n̥s}}. Cognate with Old Frisian {{m|ofs|mōnath}}, Old Saxon {{m|osx|mānuð}}, Dutch {{m|nl|maand}}, Old High German {{m|goh|mānōd}} (German {{m|de|Monat}}), Old Norse {{m|non|mánaðr}} (Danish {{m|da|måned}}, Swedish {{m|sv|månad}}), Gothic {{m|got|𐌼𐌴𐌽𐍉𐌸𐍃|tr=menoþs}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/ˈmoːnɑθ/|lang=ang}}

